WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
CalSnap opens with a meal photo. Make every meal count.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Onboarding: choose Build muscle, enter personal details, and select an activity level.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Daily targets: 2,270 kcal, 170 g protein, 227 g carbohydrates and 76 g fat.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The dashboard shows 460 kcal eaten and 1,810 kcal remaining. Tap Scan a meal.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Frame a Chicken Caesar salad in the camera. Tap the shutter.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The scan identifies ingredients, estimates portions and calculates nutrition.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Review the sample AI estimate: 560 kcal, 38 g protein, 28 g carbohydrates and 32 g fat.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Tap Save to diary. Lunch is added.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
The diary updates to 1,020 kcal eaten and 1,250 kcal remaining.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Open the Chicken Caesar salad recipe and scroll through the preparation steps.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The AI coach suggests Chicken Pepper Fry based on available ingredients.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Review the weekly calorie chart and logging streak.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
The profile contains personal goals and editable daily targets.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
CalSnap. Scan. Review. Log.
